        "notes": "The estimate covers a total of seven measurements settings, each consisting of precipitation tipping bucket and its logger, and the devices in the urban stormwater monitoring site. These sites consists of runoff probe (ultrasound), and sensors for turbidity, conductivity, and temperature. Additionally, all the sites have their own sampler, a freezer, a logger for data saving, and a modem which enables real-time data transfer to an online site. \r\n\r\nThe continuous costs of data transfer, electricity, sampling material or sample anaysis were not included in this estimate. ",
